{
  "GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm": {
    "active": true,
    "expiry": "2026-10-24",
    "notes": "braces stack-exhaustion DoS on deeply nested patterns. The advisory range is <=3.0.3 and 3.0.3 is the newest braces release, so no patched version exists to override to. It reaches the tree only through stylelint -> micromatch, a dev-only linter that never takes untrusted glob patterns: npm ls braces --omit=dev is empty, so nothing is shipped in the production bundle. Expires so the exception ages out and forces a re-check for a patched release."
  }
}
